<title>USA: AMEX to list American Exploration options.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list American Exploration options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said it would list options on American Exploration Co shares on May 30.</p>
<p>The options will have initial strike prices of 10, 12-1/2 and 15, with expirations in June, July, August and November, the exchange said. Position limits are 4,500 contracts.</p>
<p>Cohen, Duffy &amp; McGowan Inc will be the specialist on the AMEX floor.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Derivatives Desk ((312-408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
